# Task API

A simple CRUD API for managing a to-do list using Python and FastAPI.

## Features

- Create tasks
- Read all tasks
- Read a task by ID
- Update tasks
- Delete tasks
- Input validation
- Swagger UI documentation
- In-memory data storage

## Requirements

- Python 3.10+
- FastAPI
- Uvicorn

## Installation & Run

Install the dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt